[{"title":"屈原嘏辞","author":"刘敞","text":"维时仲夏，吉日维午。\n神歆既祠，锡辞以嘏。\n曰：朕之初生，皇揆予度。\n嘉朕以名，终身是守。\n抑岂不淑，不幸逢遇。\n离悯被忧，天不可诉。\n宗国为墟，宁敢自贼。\n惟朕忍生，岂不永年。\n悁悁荆人，是拯是怜。\n赴水蹈波，岁不废旃。\n既招朕魂，巫祝昔先。\n岂朕是私，将德是传。\n沦胥及溺，初亦不悛。\n其后风靡，民益轻死。\n匪朕之心，是岂为义。\n妇吊其夫，母伤其子。\n人讯其端，指予以詈。\n予亦念之，其本有自。\n昔朕婞直，不为众下。\n世予尚之，谓予好怒。\n昔朕不容，自投于江。\n世予尚之，谓予弃躬。\n既习而斗，既远益谬。\n被朕伪名，污朕以咎。\n朕生不时，乱世是遘。\n民之秉彝，嘉是直道。\n从仁于井，朕亦不取。\n汝禁其俗，幸怀朕忠。\n好竞以诬，一何不聪。\n我实鬼神，民焉是主。\n其祀其祷，予之所厚。\n予惧天明，焉事戏豫。\n予悯横流，焉事竞渡。\n予怀尧舜，焉事狎侮。\n汝惟贤人，曾不予怒。\n徇俗雷同，讥予以好。\n履常徇直，切谏尽节。\n人神所扶，未必皆福。\n去邪即正，何以有罚。\n曾非予怀，可禁其伪。\n毋使佞臣，指予为戒。\n锡尔多福，畀尔庞眉。\n使尔忠言，于君毕宜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38429,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄胡二因甫","author":"刘敞","text":"我思友人兮，在江之皋。\n去我无所兮，远哉遥遥。\n世岂无美士兮，莫慰我劳。\n愿为白鹤兮，从之逍遥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38430,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"河之水 其一","author":"刘敞","text":"河之水兮，一直而一曲。\n嗟汤汤兮安所属。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38431,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"河之水 其二","author":"刘敞","text":"河之水兮，一浊而一清。\n嗟汤汤兮何时平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38432,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"彼山诗 其一","author":"刘敞","text":"彼山之阻兮，虎豹兟兟。\n我旋而归兮，虎来即人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38433,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"彼山诗 其二","author":"刘敞","text":"彼山之澳兮，雄虺攸伏。\n我息而作兮，虺将起陆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38434,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"彼山诗 其三","author":"刘敞","text":"深不可游兮，高不可飞。\n我后而悔兮，安庸归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38435,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武溪深 其一","author":"刘敞","text":"武溪之水兮，日夜而东流。\n浅不可厉兮，深不可游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38436,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武溪深 其二","author":"刘敞","text":"武溪之山兮，高下而相乘。\n卑不可越兮，危不可凭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38437,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武溪深 其三","author":"刘敞","text":"母水于憾兮，毋山于仇。\n庚庚武溪兮，曷云其尤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38438,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀归诗 其一","author":"刘敞","text":"淮水悠悠兮，去我无舟。\n匪我无舟兮，此焉优游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38439,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀归诗 其二","author":"刘敞","text":"淮水洋洋兮，去我无梁。\n匪淮无梁兮，此焉翱翔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38440,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀归诗 其三","author":"刘敞","text":"淮水东注兮，惟禹之绩。\n古人不可及兮，吾独淹留其何得。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38441,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其一","author":"刘敞","text":"皇作大都，大都雄雄。\n奄定北国，四方来同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38442,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其二","author":"刘敞","text":"皇曰卿士，在昔圣考。\n祗遹文武，维慈幼老。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38443,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其三","author":"刘敞","text":"天监在上，既有明德。\n乃命于下，罔有不服。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38444,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其四","author":"刘敞","text":"匪允命之，亦章庆之。\n匪允服之，亦保育之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38445,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其五","author":"刘敞","text":"时维猃狁，侮予之疆。\n靡度靡虞，跳呼以狂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38446,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其六","author":"刘敞","text":"业业烝黎，载震载惊。\n侵魏及澶，群心不宁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38447,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其七","author":"刘敞","text":"帝奋厥武，百万其士。\n匪怒以棘，于三千里。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38448,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其八","author":"刘敞","text":"如虎如貔，如霆如雷。\n靡有远迩，天子其来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38449,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其九","author":"刘敞","text":"天子来止，士增其喜。\n孰偷其生，以不奋兴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38450,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其十","author":"刘敞","text":"驱之浑浑，攘之贲贲。\n靡有辀张，歼厥鲸鲲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38451,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其十一","author":"刘敞","text":"或献其宝，或请其命。\n帝振于旅，惟时既定。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38452,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其十二","author":"刘敞","text":"屹屹魏土，山河之固。\n匪山河则固，惟上帝伊祜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38453,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其十三","author":"刘敞","text":"既閟尔弓，既櫜尔矛。\n猃狁臣止，四方是休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38454,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其十四","author":"刘敞","text":"皇曰卿士，圣考之德。\n允于孝思，孝思惟则。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38455,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其十五","author":"刘敞","text":"尔视京魏，以作我都。\n以赫厥灵，俾后勿逾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38456,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其十六","author":"刘敞","text":"皇曰卿士，惟帝时功。\n时亦惟人，惟寇莱公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38457,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其十七","author":"刘敞","text":"尔慎尔止，弼予于治。\n期尔前人，用迪尔事。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38458,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其十八","author":"刘敞","text":"皇曰卿士，惟帝作武。\n垂是万年，莫敢予侮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38459,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其十九","author":"刘敞","text":"泰山之封，后土之禅。\n予监若兹，惟天是眷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38460,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其二十","author":"刘敞","text":"翼翼之土，天子国之。\n穆穆原庙，圣人则之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38461,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其二十一","author":"刘敞","text":"孰为强暴，敢不来觐。\n俾怛于威，于忠是训。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38462,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其二十二","author":"刘敞","text":"显显天子，孝德自躬。\n率是休烈，覃之北戎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38463,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏京诗 其二十三","author":"刘敞","text":"河水东注，昭哉禹绩。\n时万斯年，天子之德。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38464,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古怨诗 其一","author":"刘敞","text":"鸿雁飞矣，邕邕其族。\n孰是人斯，茕茕其独。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38465,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古怨诗 其二","author":"刘敞","text":"鸿雁飞矣，或群或伍。\n孰是人斯，茕茕其处。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38466,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古怨诗 其三","author":"刘敞","text":"天兮地兮，戴且履兮。\n孰是人斯，莫我视兮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38467,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古怨诗 其四","author":"刘敞","text":"日兮月兮，出兮没兮。\n孰是人斯，远我忽兮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38468,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗效阮步兵","author":"刘敞","text":"浮云泱郁，迨天未雨。\n习习和风，长我稷黍。\n乾道变化，群龙以序。\n元首永康，股肱是辅。\n其辅惟何，惟伊及吕。\n其康惟何，惟尧及禹。\n我食既丰，我衣惟楚。\n无有后艰，既歌且舞。\n我徂何往，于彼淮滨。\n俯玩其流，清波磷磷。\n扶摇起鹇，四海扬尘。\n孰能高蹈，独洁其身。\n众人惑惑，贤者葆真。\n独寐寤歌，忘我贱贫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38469,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四皓歌 其一","author":"刘敞","text":"与汝携手，南山之阿。\n富贵多忧，孰知其他。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38470,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四皓歌 其二","author":"刘敞","text":"大风横厉，江海荡波。\n嗟汝鳞介，伤如之何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38471,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四皓歌 其三","author":"刘敞","text":"高岩有薇，深谷有芝。\n人生实难，委曲何为。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38472,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闵雨诗 其一","author":"刘敞","text":"堪舆絪缊，一晦一明。\n或沈而晦，或亢而旸。\n自古已然，世习为常。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38473,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闵雨诗 其二","author":"刘敞","text":"民生冥冥，靡究靡知。\n其幸而吉，不幸而灾。\n猖狂妄行，惟所遇之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38474,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闵雨诗 其三","author":"刘敞","text":"天命降监，在我元圣。\n兼覆广裕，四方既定。\n惟民之恤，无所疵病。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38475,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闵雨诗 其四","author":"刘敞","text":"伊年暮春，旱久不雨。\n人曰时哉，历有常数。\n禹汤之贤，莫能弗遇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38476,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闵雨诗 其五","author":"刘敞","text":"帝独喟息，是岂足言。\n化育万物，若镕以埏。\n患在诚薄，不能动天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38477,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闵雨诗 其六","author":"刘敞","text":"退而斋心，渊默以居。\n钟鼓不设，宴游不娱。\n左右肃然，壹怀瞿瞿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38478,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闵雨诗 其七","author":"刘敞","text":"疏狱省刑，与物更始。\n内恕孔悲，引咎在己。\n爰及四海，愚智咸喜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38479,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闵雨诗 其八","author":"刘敞","text":"追悟谠直，褒进淹滞。\n声色无迕，式序在位。\n嬖习权近，慑威屏气。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38480,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闵雨诗 其九","author":"刘敞","text":"己巳乃雨，若有鬼神。\n凄凄其风，渰渰其云。\n自东徂西，罄无不均。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38481,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闵雨诗 其十","author":"刘敞","text":"匪震匪拔，匪溢匪泄。\n生我百谷，区萌毕达。\n以享以食，小大胥悦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38482,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闵雨诗 其十一","author":"刘敞","text":"天子之德，视雨之施。\n肇自京师，达于四裔。\n无有蛮貊，孚我君惠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38483,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闵雨诗 其十二","author":"刘敞","text":"天子之政，视雨之时。\n养老长幼，速哉熙熙。\n更化易俗，而民不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38484,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闵雨诗 其十三","author":"刘敞","text":"天子之庆，视雨之积。\n自天降康，时万时亿。\n眉寿无疆，以靖四国。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38485,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗二十二首 其一","author":"刘敞","text":"五都货财地，车马趋市阛。\n平明侧肩入，薄暮掉臂旋。\n意气何所期，盛衰俛仰间。\n乃知艺利合，厚薄未可原。\n张陈父子游，一旦复相残。\n万古称凶终，此独何足言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38486,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗二十二首 其二","author":"刘敞","text":"大火序炎夏，盛阳剧炮燔。\n空桐疾风来，书景中变寒。\n皇天自平分，四气尚相干。\n凉燠异朝夕，万事谁独坚。\n宛彼风中箨，众芳自此残。\n至理冥变化，履霜用为叹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38487,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗二十二首 其三","author":"刘敞","text":"至人迈龙德，世岂识潜升。\n昔在周道衰，伯阳起西征。\n胡为委一世，畏此网与罾。\n川竭山亦摧，喟然吾何称。\n岂不怀徘徊，民言憯无惩。\n亹亹强著书，后贤以为经。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38488,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗二十二首 其四","author":"刘敞","text":"昆崙邈人境，日月相蔽亏。\n上有仙圣居，帝阍俯崔嵬。\n王毋坐少广，有娥閟瑶台。\n弱水不可梁，大荒旷无厓。\n周穆昔好游，超绝仅能陪。\n方朔偷桃儿，沈浊何乃来。\n青鸟通其使，雄鸟为之媒。\n灵化信难测，真契从此推。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38489,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗二十二首 其五","author":"刘敞","text":"勿以隋侯珠，弹雀千仞峰。\n勿以和氏璧，投人昏夜中。\n弹雀不可期，投人未必容。\n大贤恶皦皦，所以明若蒙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38490,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗二十二首 其六","author":"刘敞","text":"积薪莫自高，失马莫自悲。\n薪积常先焚，马失常复归。\n人情习所近，物理岂易推。\n君看祸福间，纷纠如纆徽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38491,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗二十二首 其七","author":"刘敞","text":"朱晖乘馀香，三月觉徂暑。\n流光不相待，时节犹逆旅。\n煌煌园中花，零落会见汝。\n啼鴂鸣空林，良辰竟何许。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38492,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗二十二首 其八","author":"刘敞","text":"秋风吹宾鸿，千里飞一息。\n水阔稻粱寡，天寒霜雪逼。\n岂不抱远志，憔悴伤颜色。\n鷾鸸乘春晖，采采华羽翼。\n侧身袭人间，慧巧谁怵愓。\n出入金玉堂，户牖初不隔。\n上无饮啄患，下有居处益。\n胡为事高远，肮脏莫自适。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38493,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗二十二首 其九","author":"刘敞","text":"驽骀不下厩，骐骥行万里。\n劳逸谁为多，刍豢复谁美。\n天机信其宜，人事亦何耻。\n世无王乐徒，骏骨或空死。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38494,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗二十二首 其十","author":"刘敞","text":"悠悠浮空云，明晖何倏忽。\n造物固难恃，变化亦仓猝。\n响莫为雷霆，明莫为日月。\n日月易遮蔽，雷霆易奔绝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38495,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗二十二首 其十一","author":"刘敞","text":"古风不可复，习俗已久敝。\n咄嗟忠与信，流荡为诈术。\n诈忠惑其君，诈愚安其身。\n色厉内以荏，行违貌取仁。\n三年始横流，后来更日新。\n至公弃涂炭，正道败荆榛。\n已矣千载后，谁能反其身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38496,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗二十二首 其十二","author":"刘敞","text":"毁巢凤不至，竭泽龙不游。\n贤者有所归，得非龙凤俦。\n周公下白屋，圣德被九州。\n赵禹谢宾客，汉朝以为优。\n浇淳不相袭，用舍何其缪。\n苟循一身利，不为万姓谋。\n哀彼杖杜诗，死生遗道周。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38497,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗二十二首 其十三","author":"刘敞","text":"皇天不绝命，百姓何震愆。\n岁暮霜雪至，悠悠事南迁。\n羁鸟哀去巢，游鱼乐怀渊。\n如何道旁子，逝将不复还。\n西望周郑郊，顾想河洛间。\n伯鱼不可作，涕流为沦涟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38498,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗二十二首 其十四","author":"刘敞","text":"爨桐深灶下，埋剑古狱间。\n怨声动旁人，愤气凌彼天。\n当时颇见旌，后世称为贤。\n自古闻知音，此事或偶然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38499,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗二十二首 其十五","author":"刘敞","text":"嶰山有奇竹，老弃阴崖巅。\n太丘有神鼎，逃匿千丈渊。\n光景閟不见，音容杳无传。\n岂能向时俗，干进心拳拳。\n世贵一人敌，又称朱丝弦。\n吾欲评其风，愿君咏此篇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38500,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗二十二首 其十六","author":"刘敞","text":"凿井取泉饮，上山采薇食。\n岂不信憔悴，所愿皆我力。\n泉也非难致，薇也亦易得。\n志士耻徒饱，众人苟所获。\n牺牲畏刍拳，樊笼害羽翼。\n悟理宜在早，无为晚更惑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38501,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗二十二首 其十七","author":"刘敞","text":"蛟龙蟠深泥，鱼龟颇同调。\n变化且何有，蝘蜓亦可笑。\n煌煌千金珠，百仞閟其耀。\n风雷在所遇，隐显始独妙。\n屈身天地间，微物安得料。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38502,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]